       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RVICMP2.
      * REVOLVING INTEREST - ACCRUAL STEP
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY RVIFLG2.
       01  WS-CYCLE-DAY              PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-OUTSTANDING            PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-UNPAID-CHARGES         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-UNPAID-LEVIES          PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-UNPAID-TAXES           PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-INT-BASE               PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-RATE                   PIC 9(2)V99 VALUE 42.00.
       01  WS-INTEREST               PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-CYCLE-DAY
           ACCEPT WS-OUTSTANDING
           ACCEPT WS-UNPAID-CHARGES
           ACCEPT WS-UNPAID-LEVIES
           ACCEPT WS-UNPAID-TAXES
           CALL 'RVISET2' USING WS-CYCLE-DAY WS-REV-INT-CONTROL
           IF REV-INT-ON
              PERFORM 2000-ACCRUE
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'INTEREST: ' WS-INTEREST
           STOP RUN.
       2000-ACCRUE.
           COMPUTE WS-INT-BASE = WS-OUTSTANDING - WS-UNPAID-CHARGES
                   - WS-UNPAID-LEVIES - WS-UNPAID-TAXES
           IF WS-INT-BASE > ZERO
              COMPUTE WS-INTEREST ROUNDED =
                      (WS-INT-BASE * WS-RATE) / 1200
           END-IF.
